-// The built-in response R(t) (spec section 5.1 defaults). A smooth bump peaking at t = -2.5 - the
-// mid-tones, a couple of stops under display white - with a 3-stop full width at half maximum,
-// windowed to exactly 0 at t >= 0 and at t <= -9.
-//
