-// strongest where the emulsion is half exposed and vanishes both in clear film and in maximum
-// density. The two windows are what make it vanish rather than merely become small - without them
-// the Gaussian still has 15 percent of its peak at display white, which reads as noise on a blown
-// highlight and, worse, as noise on the letterbox bars.
